## Overview

Peerlytics (peerlytics.xyz) is an analytics dashboard, protocol explorer, and trading platform for the ZKP2P peer-to-peer fiat-to-USDC protocol on Base (Ethereum L2). It provides real-time metrics, volume trends, liquidity analysis, transaction exploration, maker/taker leaderboards, and buy/sell flows for ZKP2P deposits and intents.

Built with Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript, Firebase, Envio, and ECharts. Auth via Privy (smart wallets, embedded wallets, external EOA).

