## Buy and Sell Flows

### Sell Flow (peerlytics.xyz/sell)

1. Connect wallet via Privy
2. Set deposit amount, payment methods, currencies, and exchange rates
3. Create deposit via ZKP2P SDK on Base
4. Deposit appears in the public orderbook
5. Monitor deposit health, fills, and PnL on the profile page

### Buy Flow (peerlytics.xyz/buy)

1. Connect wallet via Privy
2. Enter purchase amount and select payment method/currency
3. View available maker quotes
4. Signal intent to a deposit
5. Complete fiat payment via PeerAuth extension (desktop) or Peer Mobile (mobile)
6. ZK proof verification releases USDC to buyer
7. Fulfillment polling with 30-minute timeout

