## Tech Stack

- **Framework:** Next.js 16, React 19
- **Language:** TypeScript (strict mode)
- **Auth:** Privy (smart wallets, embedded wallets, external EOA)
- **Data:** Envio GraphQL indexer, Firebase Firestore
- **Charts:** ECharts
- **Payments:** x402 protocol (Coinbase), ZKP2P Pay
- **Blockchain:** Base mainnet (Chain ID 8453)
- **Hosting:** Firebase App Hosting
- **Functions:** Firebase Cloud Functions Gen2 (Node 20, ESM, us-central1)
- **SDK:** `@peerlytics/sdk` on npm

